        {
          "text": "Ka onoŋo gitye ka lor piny, ma doŋ guo i agikki gaŋ, Camuel owaco bot Caulo ni, “Wac ki laticci ni okat ocit i nyimwa, Ka doŋ okato anyim, ci icuŋ kany manok, wek amiyi iŋe lok pa Lubaŋa.”",
